ation, or execution restrictions. Output only keep/replace for each id, satisfying the JSON schema.<|end_of_text|>\n<|start_of_role|>user<|end_of_role|>{\"source\":\"给 fetch cash 加日志，不改设置。\",\"context\":{\"Screen\":\"cache.go: func fetchCache(key string)\"},\"scene\":\"work\",\"unknownChineseCharacters\":[],\"hypotheses\":[{\"id\":\"e0\",\"sourceSpan\":\"fetch cash\",\"candidateSpellings\":[\"fetchCache\"],\"status\":\"unique\",\"kind\":\"english-identifier\"}]}<|end_of_text|>\n<|start_of_role|>assistant<|end_of_role|>{\"e0\":\"replace\"}<|end_of_text|>\n<|start_of_role|>user<|end_of_role|>{\"source\":\"先查 mount cash，再查 save file，不改设置。\",\"context\":{\"Screen\":\"函数：mountCache、mountCash、saveFile。\"},\"scene\":\"work\",\"unknownChineseCharacters\":[],\"hypotheses\":[{\"id\":\"e0\",\"sourceSpan\":\"mount cash\",\"candidateSpellings\":[\"mountCash\"],\"status\":\"unique\",\"kind\":\"english-identifier\"},{\"id\":\"e1\",\"sourceSpan\":\"save file\",\"candidateSpellings\":[\"saveFile\"],\"status\":\"unique\",\"kind\":\"english-identifier\"}]}<|end_of_text|>\n<|start_of_role|>assistant<|end_of_role|>{\"e0\":\"replace\",\"e1\":\"replace\"}<|end_of_text|>\n<|start_of_role|>user<|end_of_role|>{\"source\":\"先做交付侧试，没通过别发版。\",\"context\":{\"Screen\":\"交付测试验收；测试须通过。\"},\"scene\":\"work\",\"unknownChineseCharacters\":[],\"hypotheses\":[{\"id\":\"e0\",\"sourceSpan\":\"交付侧试\",\"candidateSpellings\":[\"交付测试\"],\"status\":\"unique\",\"kind\":\"chinese-character-readings\"}]}<|end_of_text|>\n<|start_of_role|>assistant<|end_of_role|>{\"e0\":\"replace\"}<|end_of_text|>\n<|start_of_role|>user<|end_of_role|>{\"source\":\"程雨南您好，材料明早发您，先别转发。\",\"context\":{\"Screen\":\"当前收件人：程语楠；材料审阅。\"},\"scene\":\"email\",\"unknownChineseCharacters\":[],\"hypotheses\":[{\"id\":\"e0\",\"sourceSpan\":\"程雨南\",\"candidateSpellings\":[\"程语楠\"],\"status\":\"unique\",\"kind\":\"chinese-character-readings\"}]}<|end_of_text|>\n<|start_of_role|>assistant<|end_of_role|>{\"e0\":\"replace\"}<|end_of_text|>\n<|start_of